### Variables
@host = localhost
@baseUrl = http://{{host}}:8080
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.data.access_token}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.data.refresh_token}}

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ========================
### AUTH
### ========================

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "phone": "6281234567890",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "full_name": "John Doe",
  "role": "user"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Google Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "google-oauth-id-token"
}

### Send WhatsApp OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login/whatsapp/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "6281234567890"
}

### Verify WhatsApp OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login/whatsapp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "6281234567890",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout (requires JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Forgot Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### Reset Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "reset-token-from-email",
  "new_password": "NewPassword123!"
}

### ========================
### PROFILE (requires JWT)
### ========================

### Get Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ========================
### UPLOAD (requires JWT)
### ========================

### Upload File
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./example.jpg
--boundary--

### ========================
### ADMIN (requires JWT + admin role)
### ========================

### Admin Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ========================
### SWAGGER
### ========================

### Swagger Docs
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger/index.html
